--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Battambang typeface, Danh Hong
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

app/src/main/assets/battambang.ttf is Battambang-Regular.ttf from Google Fonts
(https://github.com/google/fonts, ofl/battambang), by Danh Hong
(https://github.com/danhhong/Battambang), used for the Khmer key labels and
the suggestion strip.

The same typeface is also distributed as "Khmer OS Battambang" under the LGPL.
The Open Font License copy is used here instead: the OFL was written for fonts
and permits embedding without conditions on the work the font is bundled with,
which the LGPL's replaceability requirement does not straightforwardly allow.

