--------------------------------------------------------------------------
English next-word seed, Project Gutenberg
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

app/src/main/assets/bigrams_en.txt is generated by tools/gen_bigrams.py from
the Project Gutenberg selections distributed with NLTK as
nltk_data/packages/corpora/gutenberg.zip (http://gutenberg.net/): works by
Jane Austen, William Blake, Thornton W. Burgess, Sarah Cone Bryant, Lewis
Carroll, G. K. Chesterton, Maria Edgeworth, the King James Bible, Herman
Melville, John Milton, William Shakespeare and Walt Whitman.

These works are in the public domain. The asset holds counts of which word
follows which, not the texts themselves.

